      <h3 id="cert-types-user-provided-default-ingress-location_cert-types-user-provided-certificates-for-default-ingress" class="group scroll-mt-20">Location<a href="#cert-types-user-provided-default-ingress-location_cert-types-user-provided-certificates-for-default-ingress" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <p>Store user-provided certificates in a <code>tls</code> type <code>Secret</code> resource in the <code>openshift-ingress</code> namespace. Update the <code>IngressController</code> CR in the <code>openshift-ingress-operator</code> namespace to enable the use of the user-provided certificate. For more information, see "Setting a custom default certificate".</p>
      <h3 id="cert-types-user-provided-default-ingress-management_cert-types-user-provided-certificates-for-default-ingress" class="group scroll-mt-20">Management<a href="#cert-types-user-provided-default-ingress-management_cert-types-user-provided-certificates-for-default-ingress" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
